// main.fl — a virtualized list (rows recycled as it scrolls)
//
// ITEMS rows of a list, but only enough row widgets to fill the view plus two. A spacer
// child at the bottom makes the container ITEMS rows tall, so dragging, flinging and the
// scrollbar work as for a full list; loop() reads the scroll value and moves each row whose
// slot (index % SLOTS) now holds another item there, with that item's text. full.fl is the
// same list with one widget per item, to compare (project_full.json).
//
// Limit: child locations are i16 and the content height u16, so the list is at most
// ~32 767 px tall (ITEMS * ITEM_H).

const VIRTUAL = 1;
#include "vlist.fl"
